----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></span><span data-path-to-node="6,0,2" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">, missing bunker manifold save-alls</span><span data-path-to-node="6,0,3" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3223023805="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3223023805="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></span><span data-path-to-node="6,0,4" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">, structural cracks and corrosion on the accommodation ladders</span><span data-path-to-node="6,0,5" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3223023805="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3223023805="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></span><span data-path-to-node="6,0,6" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">, a missing rubber seal on the Port side Slop Tank manhole</span><span data-path-to-node="6,0,7" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3223023805="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3223023805="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></span><span data-path-to-node="6,0,8" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">, and an inoperative ballast pressure test indicator</span><span data-path-to-node="6,0,9" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3223023805="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3223023805="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></span><span data-path-to-node="6,0,10" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c2708753768="" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2708753768="" _nghost-ng-c425758869="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><p data-path-to-node="6,1" id="p-rc_3d1ed7c2bffa3c72-345" style="font-family: "Google Sans Text", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;"><span data-path-to-node="6,1,0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">Furthermore, internal structural assessment of the Ballast Tanks, cleanliness and suction testing of the Slop Tank, and inspection of the Zinc Anodes were marked as <span data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="165" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">Not Inspected</span> due to water containment and restricted manhole access during the survey</span><span data-path-to-node="6,1,1" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3223023805="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3223023805="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></span><span data-path-to-node="6,1,2" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c2708753768="" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2708753768="" _nghost-ng-c425758869="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p>', '2026-07-09', '2027-07-09', NOW(), NOW()) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET status = EXCLUDED.status, summary = EXCLUDED.summary;
