ht: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3997685714="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"></sup></source-footnote></span><span data-path-to-node="11,0,1,1,0,2" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">.<br></span><span data-path-to-node="11,0,1,2,0,0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><span data-path-to-node="11,0,1,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">-Â </span><b data-path-to-node="11,0,1,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">Planned Maintenance System (PMS):</b> PMS records are outdated (last updated in March), with no spare parts inventory or PMS guides available onboard</span><span data-path-to-node="11,0,1,2,0,1" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3997685714="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3997685714="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"></sup></source-footnote></span><span data-path-to-node="11,0,1,2,0,2" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">.<br></span><span data-path-to-node="11,0,1,3,0,0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><span data-path-to-node="11,0,1,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">Â -Â </span><b data-path-to-node="11,0,1,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">Navigation & Stability Data:</b> Compass deviation card, draft lists, and vessel stability condition data (trim, list, draft) are missing</span><span data-path-to-node="11,0,1,3,0,1" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3997685714="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3997685714="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"></sup></source-footnote></span><span data-path-to-node="11,0,1,3,0,2" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">.</span></p><p data-path-to-node="11,0,0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important;"><span data-path-to-node="11,0,1,3,0,2" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><br></span><b data-path-to-node="11,1,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">2. Hull Structure, Ballast Tanks & Deck Equipment<br></b><span data-path-to-node="11,1,1,0,0,0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="11,1,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">-Ballast Tank Condition:</b> Ballast Tanks No. 1, 2, 3, and 4 (Port & Starboard) exhibit corrosion, internal structural cracks, and thin plating</span><span data-path-to-node="11,1,1,0,0,1" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3997685714="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3997685714="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"></sup></source-footnote></span><span data-path-to-node="11,1,1,0,0,2" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">.<br></span><span data-path-to-node="11,1,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">-Â </span><b data-path-to-node="11,1,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">Restricted Inspection:</b><span style="font-size: 0.875rem;"> Ballast Tank No. 1 (P/S) could not be inspected due to heavy unmovable items (long pipes) stacked on top of the access area<br></span><span data-path-to-node="11,1,1,2,0,0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><span data-path-to-node="11,1,1,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">-Â </span><b data-path-to-node="11,1,1,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">Cathodic Protection:</b> Anode capacity in all ballast tanks is insufficient (minimum capacity only)</span><span data-path-to-node="11,1,1,2,0,1" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3997685714="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3997685714="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"></sup></source-footnote></span><span data-path-to-node="11,1,1,2,0,2" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">.<br></span><span data-path-to-node="11,1,1,3,0,0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><span data-path-to-node="11,1,1,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">-Â </span><b data-path-to-node="11,1,1,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">Deck Fittings & Gear:</b> Bent and missing railings at the forecastle and near Ballast Tank No. 2, malfunctioning aft bollard, and lack of lifting gear maintenance records</span><span data-path-to-node="11,1,1,3,0,1" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3997685714="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3997685714="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"></sup></source-footnote></span><span data-path-to-node="11,1,1,3,0,2" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">.</span></p><p data-path-to-node="11,0,0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important;"><span data-path-to-node="11,1,1,3,0,2" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><br></span><b data-path-to-node="11,2,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">3. Machinery & Engine Room Condition<br></b><span data-path-to-node="11,2,1,0,0,0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="11,2,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">- System Leaks & Failures:</b> Seawater pump is leaking, Auxiliary Engine 3 (AE 3) has oil leaking from the packing, and fuel/lube oil purifiers are malfunctioning</span><span data-path-to-node="11,2,1,0,0,1" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3997685714="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-