re missing, and no Engine Control Room (ECR) is present</span><span data-path-to-node="11,2,1,2,0,1" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3997685714="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3997685714="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"></sup></source-footnote></span><span data-path-to-node="11,2,1,2,0,2" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">.</span></p><p data-path-to-node="11,0,0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important;"><span data-path-to-node="11,2,1,2,0,2" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><br></span><b data-path-to-node="11,3,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">4. Cargo Tanks & Hold Readiness<br></b><span data-path-to-node="11,3,1,0,0,0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="11,3,1,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">- Cargo Hold Cleanliness:</b> Cargo hold is dirty with oil-mixed water</span><span data-path-to-node="11,3,1,0,0,1" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3997685714="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3997685714="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"></sup></source-footnote></span><span data-path-to-node="11,3,1,0,0,2" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">