span><span style="font-size: 0.875rem;">Full visual inspection of the </span><span data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="30" style="font-size: 0.875rem;">Cargo Tanks (steel structure, coating, and toe brackets)</span><span style="font-size: 0.875rem;"> could not be performed due to Fuel Oil (FO) and BSO cargo on board. Internal integrity relies strictly on historical drydock reports.</span></p></li><li google="" sans="" text",="" sans-serif="" !important;="" line-height:="" 1.15="" margin-top:="" 0px="" !important;"=""><p data-path-to-node="6,3,0" id="p-rc_b88178ce5c00ca30-235" style="line-height: 1.15 !important;"><span data-path-to-node="6,3,0,0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="6,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">Machinery & Deck Equipment:</b> Active leaks were noted on the seawater pump and AE 3, fuel/lube purifiers require overhaul, ER communication is impaired, and minor deck railing damage was observed</span><span data-path-to-node="6,3,0,1" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3997685714="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3997685714="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></span><span data-path-to-node="6,3,0,2" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c4136037586="" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c4136037586="" _nghost-ng-c1221529496="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li google="" sans="" text",="" sans-serif="" !important;="" line-height:="" 1.15="" margin-top:="" 0px="" !important;"=""><p data-path-to-node="6,4,0" id="p-rc_b88178ce5c00ca30-236" style="line-height: 1.15 !important;"><span data-path-to-node="6,4,0,0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><b data-path-to-node="6,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">Environmental Management & Maintenance:</b> Bilge areas in the engine room and cargo hold require proper waste management due to oil mixture; PMS documentation and equipment manuals need to be updated and completed</span><span data-path-to-node="6,4,0,1" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3997685714="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3997685714="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"><!----></sup></source-footnote><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></span><span data-path-to-node="6,4,0,2" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c4136037586="" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">  <source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c4136037586="" _nghost-ng-c1221529496="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"></source-inline-chip></sources-carousel-inline></p></li>', '2026-08-24', '2027-08-24', NOW(), NOW()) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET status = EXCLUDED.status, summary = EXCLUDED.summary;
INSERT INTO surveys (id, vessel_id, surveyor_id, broker_id, surveyor_name, condition_type, status, form_status, location, date_of_survey, due_date, concern_from_surveyor, resume_from_surveyor, summary, policy_period_start, policy_period_end, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (944, 659, 13, 9, 'SAMUEL MISDOM', 'Survey', 'Completed', 'complete', 'Surabaya', '2026-09-09', '2026-09-09', '<p data-path-to-node="0" style="font-family: " google="" sans="" text",="" sans-serif="" !important;="" line-height:="" 1.15="" !important;"=""><b>CONCERN FROM SURVEYOR</b></p><p data-path-to-node="1" id="p-rc_a9d7ba6445081b93-217" style="font-family: " google="" sans="" text",="" sans-serif="" !important;="" line-height:="" 1.15="" !important;"=""><span data-path-to-node="1,0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><b>CRITICAL HULL & STRUCTURAL INTEGRITY:Â </b></span><span style="font-size: 0.875rem;">EXTENSIVE CORROSION, THINNING PLATES, AND SEVERE HOLES ON THE MAIN DECK (PORT, STARBOARD, BOW, AFT), CRACKED BULWARKS, AND DAMAGED CARGO HOLD BULKHEADS POSE AN IMMEDIATE RISKÂ </span><span data-path-to-node="1,0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">OF STRUCTURAL FAILURE AND WATER INGRESS</span><span data-path-to-node="1,1" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3694776397="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3694776397="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"></sup></source-footnote></span><span data-path-to-node="1,2" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">.</span></p><p data-path-to-node="1" id="p-rc_a9d7ba6445081b93-217" style="font-family: " google="" sans="" text",="" sans-serif="" !important;="" line-height:="" 1.15="" !important;"=""><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c1714849028="" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1714849028="" _nghost-ng-c2003249625="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><p data-path-to-node="2" id="p-rc_a9d7ba6445081b93-218" style="font-family: " google="" sans="" text",="" sans-serif="" !important;="" line-height:="" 1.15="" !important;"=""><span data-path-to-node="2,0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><b>INOPERATIONAL EMERGENCY & NAVIGATION SYSTEMS:Â </b></span><span data-path-to-node="2,0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">THE EMERGENCY GENERATOR IS NON-OPERATIONAL (UNDER REPAIR), EMERGENCY STEERING CHANGEOVER INSTRUCTIONS ARE MISSING, AND THE ECHO SOUNDER IS FAULTY, SEVERELY COMPROMISING VESSEL SAFETY AND MANEUVERING CAPABILITY DURING EMERGENCY SITUATIONS</span><span data-path-to-node="2,1" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3694776397="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3694776397="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"></sup></source-footnote></span><span data-path-to-node="2,2" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">.</span></p><p data-path-to-node="2" id="p-rc_a9d7ba6445081b93-218" style="font-family: " google="" sans="" text",="" sans-serif="" !important;="" line-height:="" 1.15="" !important;"=""><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c1714849028="" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1714849028="" _nghost-ng-c2003249625="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><p data-path-to-node="3" id="p-rc_a9d7ba6445081b93-219" style="font-family: " google="" sans="" text",="" sans-serif="" !important;="" line-height:="" 1.15="" !important;"=""><span data-path-to-node="3,0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><b>NON-COMPLIANCE WITH MARPOL / POLLUTION PREVENTION:Â </b></span><span data-path-to-node="3,0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">THE VESSEL LACKS MANDATORY SPILL PREVENTION EQUIPMENT (MISSING SCUPPER PLUGS, UNAPPROVED USE OF SAND INSTEAD OF PROPER ABSORBENTS, AND POORLY MARKED/CORRODED SOPEP LOCKER), EXPOSING THE VESSEL TO HIGH RISK OF ENVIRONMENTAL POLLUTION AND PORT STATE CONTROL (PSC) DETENTION</span><span data-path-to-node="3,1" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3694776397="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3694776397="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"></sup></source-footnote></span><span data-path-to-node="3,2" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">.</span></p><p data-path-to-node="3" id="p-rc_a9d7ba6445081b93-219" style="font-family: " google="" sans="" text",="" sans-serif="" !important;="" line-height:="" 1.15="" !important;"=""><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c1714849028="" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1714849028="" _nghost-ng-c2003249625="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><p data-path-to-node="4" id="p-rc_a9d7ba6445081b93-220" style="font-family: " google="" sans="" text",="" sans-serif="" !important;="" line-height:="" 1.15="" !important;"=""><span data-path-to-node="4,0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><b>DECK & MOORING EQUIPMENT DEFICIENCIES:Â </b></span><span data-path-to-node="4,0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">NON-FUNCTIONAL BOLLARDS, MISSING STARBOARD WINCH MOTOR, BROKEN ACCOMMODATION LADDER, AND DAMAGED HATCH COVER RUBBER SEALS IMPACT DAILY MARINE OPERATIONS, CREW SAFETY, AND CARGO PROTECTION</span><span data-path-to-node="4,1" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3694776397="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3694776397="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"></sup></source-footnote></span><span data-path-to-node="4,2" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">.</span></p><p data-path-to-node="4" id="p-rc_a9d7ba6445081b93-220" style="font-family: " google="" sans="" text",="" sans-serif="" !important;="" line-height:="" 1.15="" !important;"=""><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c1714849028="" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1714849028="" _nghost-ng-c2003249625="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><p data-path-to-node="5" id="p-rc_a9d7ba6445081b93-221" style="font-family: " google="" sans="" text",="" sans-serif="" !important;="" line-height:="" 1.15="" !important;"=""><span data-path-to-node="5,0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><b>STATUTORY & CERTIFICATION:Â </b></span><span data-path-to-node="5,0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">THE ABSENCE OF THE ULTRASONIC THICKNESS (UT) TEST CERTIFICATE ONBOARD AND OUTDATED NOTICE TO MARINERS (NTM) VIOLATE CLASS AND FLAG STATE STATUTORY REQUIREMENTS</span><span data-path-to-node="5,1" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3694776397="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3694776397="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"></sup></source-footnote></span><span data-path-to-node="5,2" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">.</span></p><p data-path-to-node="5" id="p-rc_a9d7ba6445081b93-221" style="font-family: " google="" sans="" text",="" sans-serif="" !important;="" line-height:="" 1.15="" !important;"=""><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c1714849028="" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c1714849028="" _nghost-ng-c2003249625="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><p data-path-to-node="6" id="p-rc_a9d7ba6445081b93-222" style="font-family: " google="" sans="" text",="" sans-serif="" !important;="" line-height:="" 1.15="" !important;"=""><span data-path-to-node="6,0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><b>UNVERIFIED SUBMERGED AREAS:Â </b></span><span data-path-to-node="6,0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">ZINC ANODES COULD NOT BE EVALUATED DUE TO WATER SUBMERSION, PRESENTING HIDDEN RISKS OF INTERNAL CORROSION AND SACRIFICIAL ANODE DEPLETION</span><span data-path-to-node="6,1" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3694776397="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3694776397="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important;"></sup></source-footnote></span><span data-path-to-node="6,2" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">.</span></p>', '<li style="font-family: " google="" sans="" text",="" sans-serif="" !important;="" line-height:="" 1.15="" margin-top:="" 0px="" !important;"=""><p data-path-to-node="0,0,0" style="line-height: 1.15 !important;"><b>STATUTORY & CERTIFICATION<br></b><span data-path-to-node="0,0,1,0" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;">UT THICKNESS TEST CERTIFICATE UNAVAILABLE ONBOARD. NOTICE TO MARINERS (NTM) OUTDATED (MAY 2026)</span><span data-path-to-node="0,0,1,1" style="font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><source-footnote _nghost-ng-c3694776397="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"><sup _ngcontent-ng-c3694776397="" class="superscript" style="line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; font-size: 16px !important; background-color: transparent !important